1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,199
Warga sini minta
jalannya ditambal.

2
00:00:02,211 --> 00:00:03,528
Yang datang
malah panggung.

3
00:00:03,926 --> 00:00:06,239
Selamat datang di
Republik WKWKWK.

4
00:00:06,273 --> 00:00:07,221
Hari pertama…

5
00:00:07,297 --> 00:00:08,814
kita mau
meresmikan jalan.

6
00:00:09,133 --> 00:00:10,337
Jalannya belum jadi.

7
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:12,391
Nah, Pak Bahlil datang.

8
00:00:12,391 --> 00:00:13,979
Warga langsung
kumpul.

9
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,633
Kirain mau dicek
lubangnya…

10
00:00:15,907 --> 00:00:17,684
…ternyata mau
dipotong pitanya.

11
00:00:17,988 --> 00:00:18,936
Diindaa!

12
00:00:19,012 --> 00:00:20,440
Yang penting
kita mulai dulu!

13
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,146
Mulai nambalnya kapan?

14
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:23,912
Pertanyaan bagus.

15
00:00:23,945 --> 00:00:25,054
Sayangnya…

16
00:00:25,054 --> 00:00:26,742
nggak ada di
susunan acara.

17
00:00:27,052 --> 00:00:29,758
Sebelum difoto,
semua disuruh geser.

18
00:00:29,842 --> 00:00:31,110
Bukan supaya muat…

19
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,371
…supaya lubangnya
nggak kelihatan.

20
00:00:34,031 --> 00:00:35,092
Keprok atuh!

21
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:37,360
Eh… ini jalan
masih rusak.

22
00:00:37,415 --> 00:00:38,434
Betul apa tidak?

23
00:00:38,944 --> 00:00:40,062
Acara selesai.

24
00:00:40,096 --> 00:00:41,385
Foto sudah bagus.

25
00:00:41,461 --> 00:00:42,395
Tinggal pulang.

26
00:00:43,192 --> 00:00:45,691
Oh. Lubangnya
belum ikut selesai.

27
00:00:46,451 --> 00:00:48,328
Nah! Sekarang baru
turun langsung!

28
00:00:48,328 --> 00:00:49,200
Keprok atuh!

29
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,541
Tadi warga yang
disuruh sabar.

30
00:00:51,605 --> 00:00:53,520
Sekarang beliau
yang disuruh dorong.

31
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:55,469
Pejabatnya dorong dulu.

32
00:00:55,481 --> 00:00:57,453
Sekarang, warga
yang nentuin!

33
00:00:57,529 --> 00:00:58,809
Follow buat jadi warga

34
00:00:58,809 --> 00:01:00,461
Republik WKWKWK.

35
00:01:00,559 --> 00:01:03,000
Di sini, kalian bukan
cuma penonton.

36
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:03,887
Kalian ikut nentuin

37
00:01:03,887 --> 00:01:05,334
republik ini
mau jadi apa!

38
00:01:05,334 --> 00:01:06,571
Republik ini kita bangun

39
00:01:06,571 --> 00:01:07,732
dari komentar kalian.

40
00:01:07,894 --> 00:01:09,226
Mulai dari jalan ini:

41
00:01:09,259 --> 00:01:10,399
mau ditambal,

42
00:01:10,411 --> 00:01:11,715
atau dibikin kolam lele?

43
00:01:11,819 --> 00:01:12,980
Tulis usulanmu!

44
00:01:13,056 --> 00:01:14,294
Yang terpilih
kita wujudkan

45
00:01:14,294 --> 00:01:15,632
di episode berikutnya.

46
00:01:15,807 --> 00:01:16,874
Biar yang nambah

47
00:01:16,874 --> 00:01:18,460
bukan spanduk doang!

